  "bio": "Step into the artistic haven of Bueno Tattoo Estudio, where the masterful Alexis Narvaez brings visions to life in illustrative, dotwork, and neotraditional styles. Nestled in the heart of Neuquén, Argentina, the studio offers a bespoke tattooing experience with consultations available via email, welcoming ink enthusiasts to an open agenda of creativity and precision.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Neuquen, Neuquen, Argentina\n\n▪️Agenda abierta\n Consultas vía mail\n @clown.neuquen \n📍Neuquen, Argentina",
